# Copy to .env and choose your own values. .env is never committed.
#
# Nothing needs to go here yet. The web app is built static and served as plain
# files, so whatever is in this file ends up in what the browser downloads:
# treat every value as public, and give it the PUBLIC_ prefix SvelteKit wants
# before the app can read it at all.
#
# Server secrets — the Join Code, the Player password, the Firebase service
# account — belong to apps/server/.env and never here.
